# id: ORACLE-facts-last-sync
# blinds: the harness fact "did THIS Sync make THE WAL's group durable"
# covering-lane: cpp-sweep
# expect: killed
# control-lane: cpp-build
# expect-control: alive
#
# HARNESS-012, restored: the one-line version that asked for the promoted flag
# of the LAST kWritableFileSync in the whole ledger. Every clause of it was true
# only because the WAL was once the only file this engine synced.
